              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "4.25.21 Only modification I made was cutting back the amount of oil, and I used olive oil instead of vegetable oil. I steamed the asparagus spears in my microwave steam pot for 1-1/2 minutes, and they were perfect, tender but still crisp. Really enjoyed that fresh, tangy kick you get from the lime. Tasty recipe, thanks for sharing.",
